/Frame { %  on  stack \psk@dimen
  CLW mul /a ED % save radius
  3 -1 roll 
  2 copy gt { exch } if 
  a sub /y2 ED 
  a add /y1 ED 
  2 copy gt { exch } if 
  a sub /x2 ED 
  a add /x1 ED 
  1 index 0 eq { pop pop Rect } { OvalFrame } ifelse 
} def
